{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/b2cf028b6b8e0d780bb78ce7c7e3a596.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI'll tell you another story.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThis is a story about a girl and a wish.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cA warm and romantic fairy tale\u2026\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/33dce2295199caa71a28b01c9a22499a.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about &quot;wishes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interwoven with feelings of sadness and healing, where terrifying scenes blend with dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cLet me fulfill your wish for you, but the corresponding price is\u2026\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, players will take on the role of a girl named Qiu Xiaoqi, waking up in a strange room. She will explore the mysterious room filled with puzzles alongside a mysterious young man with white hair, unraveling layers of mechanisms and uncovering the truth behind her loss of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/7f1d5eafd03c46d218ad54b1ad7e77a1.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey full of choices and unknowns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >players will face various challenges as they explore in a terrifying environment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experiencing the profound emotional journeys of the characters through memories and dreams, exploring the wishes hidden deep within their hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will this wish be fulfilled? How will this story unfold? Everything is for you to write\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/1a65d0754c85879bbf801dcc4754c6f1.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/d17aad6310643dc7cb0ace1b3a66f2b2.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive horror atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unknown fear draws you deeply into it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate puzzle design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative mechanisms provide a unique exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart-pounding storyline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The profound emotional journeys of the characters present a moving tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich sound performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful music and intense sound effects perfectly blend into the game atmosphere.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ffa90d73c84144d3991c36b6b2a95666.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Type:</strong> Horror Puzzle<br><strong>Number of Endings:</strong> 7 (*updated in 2024)<br><strong>Estimated Playtime: 2</strong>-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br>Movement: Arrow keys<br>Investigate/Confirm: Z/Space/Enter<br>Menu/Cancel: X/ESC<br>Save Management: F5<br>Resolution Adjustment: F6<br>Run: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/2416b866d40f43f05ced4fd1bc287739.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Author: \u79cb\u4e4b\u5fe7\u90c1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Artist: \u96e8\u516e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Publisher: Eternal Dream Studio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more staff, please see the in-game credits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ac7c0b8b26b0034ae50b47fbe2d8a330.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first horror puzzle game I developed in 2016.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was my first time making a horror puzzle game, so I hope everyone understands if there are any shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not contain any jump-scare CG flashes, so there\u2019s no need to worry about being startled by CG suddenly~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has undergone multiple tests, but if there are any remaining bugs, please report them immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback channel: <a href=\"mailto:413228337@qq.com\">413228337@qq.com</a></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2dc0fef1f23a3729e5f63c920f81a3bec8a50c68.jpg","localized_name":"Where am I?","name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/2dc0fef1f23a3729e5f63c920f81a3bec8a50c68.jpg"},{"icon":"9131d9843bf92d7879c5f623a923796fb457e220.jpg","localized_name":"White Feather","name":"White Feather","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/9131d9843bf92d7879c5f623a923796fb457e220.jpg"},{"icon":"dca263f385f8ba39e6f433f76b287b7cf4184dde.jpg","localized_name":"New item for illumination","name":"New item for illumination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/dca263f385f8ba39e6f433f76b287b7cf4184dde.jpg"},{"icon":"9d81bf08662ac3c3c2ee10e7e1e320898c4eab10.jpg","localized_name":"Cry","name":"Cry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/9d81bf08662ac3c3c2ee10e7e1e320898c4eab10.jpg"},{"icon":"15c3ae4f3d78e65ddb2703484762aec232845758.jpg","localized_name":"Mistrust","name":"Mistrust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/15c3ae4f3d78e65ddb2703484762aec232845758.jpg"},{"icon":"012d31bd5cd5ac74860ff6f63bea36c05e29e5b5.jpg","localized_name":"BUG?","name":"BUG?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/012d31bd5cd5ac74860ff6f63bea36c05e29e5b5.jpg"},{"icon":"f12aae46f007f5b0515efc5741965e7e9eb14309.jpg","localized_name":"Candle","name":"Candle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/f12aae46f007f5b0515efc5741965e7e9eb14309.jpg"},{"icon":"755dfe01709071b3a43bd91b38f265086b01f58a.jpg","localized_name":"Curiosity","name":"Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/755dfe01709071b3a43bd91b38f265086b01f58a.jpg"},{"icon":"ec53f956ff166d9e00148fb588c5b9597630966e.jpg","localized_name":"Prophet","name":"Prophet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/ec53f956ff166d9e00148fb588c5b9597630966e.jpg"},{"icon":"e6a231b7d6ad057ccf2740f2529ec492dce00c6d.jpg","localized_name":"Wrong place to hide","name":"Wrong place to hide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/869840/e6a231b7d6ad057ccf2740f2529ec492dce00c6d.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/869840?t=1758257172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758257172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758257172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758257172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Game Information</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Feather Of Praying&quot; is a horror puzzle RPG released in 2016, which has received numerous positive reviews since its launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was officially launched on Steam in 2018 and underwent a major update in 2024,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adding new endings while also bringing new puzzle content and performance experiences.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/b2cf028b6b8e0d780bb78ce7c7e3a596.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI'll tell you another story.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThis is a story about a girl and a wish.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cA warm and romantic fairy tale\u2026\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/33dce2295199caa71a28b01c9a22499a.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about &quot;wishes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interwoven with feelings of sadness and healing, where terrifying scenes blend with dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cLet me fulfill your wish for you, but the corresponding price is\u2026\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, players will take on the role of a girl named Qiu Xiaoqi, waking up in a strange room. She will explore the mysterious room filled with puzzles alongside a mysterious young man with white hair, unraveling layers of mechanisms and uncovering the truth behind her loss of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/7f1d5eafd03c46d218ad54b1ad7e77a1.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey full of choices and unknowns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >players will face various challenges as they explore in a terrifying environment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experiencing the profound emotional journeys of the characters through memories and dreams, exploring the wishes hidden deep within their hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will this wish be fulfilled? How will this story unfold? Everything is for you to write\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/1a65d0754c85879bbf801dcc4754c6f1.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/d17aad6310643dc7cb0ace1b3a66f2b2.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive horror atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unknown fear draws you deeply into it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate puzzle design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative mechanisms provide a unique exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart-pounding storyline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The profound emotional journeys of the characters present a moving tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich sound performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful music and intense sound effects perfectly blend into the game atmosphere.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ffa90d73c84144d3991c36b6b2a95666.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Type:</strong> Horror Puzzle<br><strong>Number of Endings:</strong> 7 (*updated in 2024)<br><strong>Estimated Playtime: 2</strong>-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br>Movement: Arrow keys<br>Investigate/Confirm: Z/Space/Enter<br>Menu/Cancel: X/ESC<br>Save Management: F5<br>Resolution Adjustment: F6<br>Run: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/2416b866d40f43f05ced4fd1bc287739.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Author: \u79cb\u4e4b\u5fe7\u90c1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Artist: \u96e8\u516e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Publisher: Eternal Dream Studio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more staff, please see the in-game credits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ac7c0b8b26b0034ae50b47fbe2d8a330.avif?t=1758257172\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first horror puzzle game I developed in 2016.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was my first time making a horror puzzle game, so I hope everyone understands if there are any shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not contain any jump-scare CG flashes, so there\u2019s no need to worry about being startled by CG suddenly~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has undergone multiple tests, but if there are any remaining bugs, please report them immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback channel: <a href=\"mailto:413228337@qq.com\">413228337@qq.com</a></p>","developers":["\u79cb\u4e4b\u5fe7\u90c1"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/header.jpg?t=1758257172","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u4e00\u3001\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u6240\u6709\u7acb\u7ed8\u3001CG\u7d20\u6750\u5747\u4e3a\u539f\u521b\uff0c\u672a\u7ecf\u5141\u8bb8\u7981\u6b62\u632a\u7528\u3002<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u4e8c\u3001\u7981\u6b62\u5bf9\u6e38\u620f\u8fdb\u884c\u89e3\u5305\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u7531\u6b64\u884d\u751f\u7684\uff0c\u5305\u542b\u4e14\u4e0d\u9650\u4e8e\uff1a\u64c5\u81ea\u63d0\u53d6\u5e76\u632a\u7528\u3001\u53d1\u5e03\u6e38\u620f\u7684\u7d20\u6750\u8d44\u6e90\u7b49\u884c\u4e3a\u3002<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u4e09\u3001\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u5f15\u7528\u7684\u97f3\u4e50\u7d20\u6750\u8457\u4f5c\u6743\u5f52\u539f\u4f5c\u8005\u6240\u6709\uff0c\u5982\u679c\u9700\u8981\u4f7f\u7528\uff0c\u8bf7\u5230\u539f\u7ad9\u70b9\u81ea\u884c\u4e0b\u8f7d\u5e76\u6309\u7167\u4f7f\u7528\u89c4\u7ea6\u4f7f\u7528\u3002<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u56db\u3001\u7981\u6b62\u4efb\u4f55\u56e2\u4f53\u6216\u8005\u4e2a\u4eba\u5bf9\u6e38\u620f\u8fdb\u884c\u4e8c\u6b21\u53d1\u5e03